        {
            "id": "4c394716be575ad2fa5264eb94faba6d4b74bf6bd868e162d88809943a858add_6",
            "type": "list",
            "title": "1. Modular Skill Loading Protocol",
            "content": "Agent activated → Check frontmatter \"skills:\" → Read SKILL.md (INDEX) → Read specific sections.\n\n- **Selective Reading:** DO NOT read ALL files in a skill folder. Read `SKILL.md` first, then only read sections matching the user's request.\n- **Rule Priority:** P0 (Workspace Rules in `.agents/rules/`) > P1 (Agent `.md`) > P2 (SKILL.md). All rules are binding.",
            "raw_content": "Agent activated → Check frontmatter \"skills:\" → Read SKILL.md (INDEX) → Read specific sections.\n\n- **Selective Reading:** DO NOT read ALL files in a skill folder. Read `SKILL.md` first, then only read sections matching the user's request.\n- **Rule Priority:** P0 (Workspace Rules in `.agents/rules/`) > P1 (Agent `.md`) > P2 (SKILL.md). All rules are binding.",
            "heading_path": [
                "Core Protocol - AG Kit",
                "CRITICAL: AGENT & SKILL PROTOCOL (START HERE)",
                "1. Modular Skill Loading Protocol"
            ],
            "content_hash": "1fcc60d36936cec6841d3abca83b238146b21c7b54ca34c3f8b93dc3a518f09a"
        },
        {
